    "lesson": {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card",
          "emoji": "💡",
          "title": "",
          "content": "小升初语法第12讲：介词（一）\n知识点讲解与考题精练（有答案）\n介词是一种用来表示词与词、词与句之间的关系的虚词，在句子中不能单独作成分。介词后面一般有名词代词或相当于名词的其他词类，短语或从句作它的宾语。介词和它的宾语构成介词词组，在句中作状语、表语、补语或介词宾语。介词可以分为时间介词、地点介词、方式介词、原因介词和其他介词。\n介词是英语中最活跃的词类之一，特别是一些常用介词的搭配力特别强，可以用来表示各种不同的意思。"
        },
        {
          "type": "card",
          "emoji": "💡",
          "title": "知识点1",
          "content": "介词的分类\n常用介词按词义分为时间介词、地点介词、方位介词、方式介词、原因介词等。\n本章主要学习以下三部分内容：时间介词、地点介词，其他常用介词。"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "content": "时间介词\n本课我们重点学习at, on, in这三个易混淆的时间介词。\nat用于具体的、很短的时间\n用于具体的钟点前\nat 9:00在九点钟        at 4:30在四点半        at seven o’clock在七点钟\n用于很短的时间前\nat noon 在中午         at midnight 在半夜       at night 在夜间\n用于三餐前\nat breakfast 在早餐时      at lunch 在午餐时\n用于某些固定搭配中\nat the moment 此刻               at the beginning 开始\nat the end 最后                   at that/this time 在那/这个时候\non用于某天或某几天\n用在某一天\non April 20th                                on September\n在4月20日                               1st 在9月1日\non the morning of...在...早上         on a sunny day 在一个阳光明媚的日子\n用在星期前\non Friday 在周五                          on Sunday morning 在周日早上\non weekends 在周末                       on weekdays 在工作日\non the afternoon of Monday 在周一下午\n用于节假日前\nin 用于较长的时间\n泛指一天的早上/下午/傍晚\nin the morning 在早上      in the afternoon 在下午      in the evening 在晚上\n表示周、月、季节、年等大于一天的时间\nin a week 一周内            in a month 一月内             in March 在3月\nin summer 在夏天           in 2021 在2021年\n小升初语法：介词专项训(有答案)\n一、单项选择。\n(   )1.I walk home      school.\nA.after            B.by           C.close\n(   )2.--When was she born?\n--She was born      2006.\nA.on             B.in            C.at\n(   )3.I stayed at home      my grandma.\nA.and            B.to              C.with\n(   )4.I usually go to work     . That's a good exercise.\nA.by bus              B.by ship            C.on foot\n(   )5.You can see a picture      Shanghai on the wall.\nA.of           B.in             C.for\n(   )6.Jenny likes to sit      the sun.\nA.on            B.in            C.under\n(   )7.--Harbin is      the northeast      China.\n--The temperature there is very low in winter.\nA.in;in            B.in;of              C.on;of\n(   )8.May I speak      Colin?\nA.at             B.to            C.for\n(   )9.Let's make some cakes      my grandpa.\nA.from              B.for              C.give\n(   )10.Sanya is famous      its sandy beaches.\nA.of           B.for            C.to\n(   )11.Alice is sitting in front of me. Lucy is sitting behind me. So I'm     them.\nA.under            B.beside           C.between\n(   )12.They often get up      six in the morning.\nA.on           B.at              C.in\n(   )13.I went to zoo      bus.\nA.by              B./                  C.on\n(   )14.There are some photos    my family.\nA.from            B.for              C.of\n(   )15.We should sleep well      night.\nA.at              B.in              C.on\n(   )16.Children's Day is      June 1st.\nA.on             B.of             C.at\n(   )17.We arrive      school at 8:30.\nA.in               B.for                C.at\n(   )18.This picture      a panda is for you.\nA.of             B.for             C.to\n(   )19.I'm reading some books      flowers.\nA.on              B.for            C.about\n(   )20.Don't worry      my study, Mom. I do well at school.\nA.about            B.for              C.of\n(   )21.The house is      the school and the bank.It's easy to find it.\nA.under            B.between              C.next\n(   )22.We often wash the dishes      dinner.\nA.after          B.at             C.on\n(   )23.Wu Peng had a race      his father and Max.\nA.with             B.for                 C.and\n(   )24.Please put this cap     .\nA.buy               B.on                C.at\n(   )25.Some animals sleep      a long time in winter.\nA.four         B.for            C.and             D.from\n参考答案\n1.A  2.B  3.C  4.C  5.A\n6.B【解析】in the sun在阳光下\n7.B【解析】the northeast of China在中国的东北部\n8.B  9.B  10.B  11.C  12.B  13.A  14.C  15.A  16.A  17.C  18.A  19.C  20.A  21.B  22.A  23.A  24B  25.B\n介词类别 |\n表示地点（包括动向） | about, above, across, after, along, among, around, at, before, behind, below, beneath, beside, between, beyond, by, down, from, in, into, near, off, on, over, through, to, towards, under, up, upon, with, without, within\n表示时间 | at, in, on, by, after, before, since, for, during, within, throughout, over, until/till, between\n表示原因 | because of, owing to, due to, for, with\n表示方式、方法或手段 | by, in, with\n表示“除...外” | except, besides, but, except for\n表示“数量” | about, around, over\n表示“关于”的 | on, about\n表示“所属”“部分与整体关系” | of\non National Day 在国庆节 | on Christmas Eve 在圣诞节前夕\non New Year’s Day 在新年 | on his birthday 在他生日那天"
        }
      ]
    },
